// The Town Map of Alola (plan 23, wave 91; docs/data-files.md, "The region map"): the four islands, each a matrix of its own,
// laid side by side on one grid of 28 cells by 26 as the islands lie: Melemele in the north-west at 0,0 (its own 16 by 16),
// Ula'ula in the north-east at 16,0, Akala in the south-east at 16,12 and Poni in the south-west at 0,16 (`islands`, each
// the cell of its north-west chunk). A block on every cell of an open area; every word is ours. Fly lands at the player's
// house and at the islands' Pokémon Centers, each once it has been come to. Aether Paradise, reached by the ferry alone, is
// shown at Heahea City, where the ferry sails from.
{
  "map": "Melemele",
  "columns": 28,
  "rows": 26,
  "islands": {
    "Ulaula": "16,0",
    "Akala": "16,12",
    "Poni": "0,16"
  },
